{"id":"23.08.GrindsetStudios","contentHtml":"<p>My current indie studio, founded to create high-quality mobile games. Here I realized my long-held dream: not just to release products, but to build a <strong>powerful technological foundation</strong> that would meet the best industry practices and allow focusing on developing the <strong>central idea of the game</strong>.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>As a founder and sole developer, I am responsible for 100% of all aspects: from architecture and code to game design, publishing, and marketing.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2>Main Technological Asset: Modular Ecosystem</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I invested time in creating my own <strong>infrastructure of large studio level</strong>, so that my projects were scalable and technological \"out of the box\".</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>At the heart of the studio lies the <strong>modular architecture</strong> developed by me:</p>\n<h3>PlatformUnified SDK (\"One API, Every Platform\")</h3>\n<p>This is a universal framework that fully <strong>abstracts game logic from platform services</strong>.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Cross-platform out of the box:</strong> Game code is written once and works everywhere (Android, iOS, WebGL), and the SDK itself \"substitutes\" the necessary implementation for ads, IAP, analytics, saves, leaderboards, and so on.</li>\n<li><strong>Business Flexibility:</strong> Allows <strong>replacing key services</strong> (for example, an ad network) by <strong>changing one configuration line</strong>, rather than weeks of rewriting code.</li>\n<li><strong>Powerful Emulation Mode:</strong> Allows testing everything (even IAP and ads) directly in the Unity editor, saving hundreds of hours on builds.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Ecosystem of Reusable Modules</h3>\n<p>Created a set of dozens of loosely coupled modules covering 90% of any project's needs. Key ones:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Advanced UI Architecture:</strong> Flexible system for managing windows, widgets, and animations.</li>\n<li><strong>Data-driven Sound System:</strong> With pooling, priorities, and control via Enum.</li>\n<li><strong>Secure Save System:</strong> With <strong>default encryption</strong>, migration, and data size optimization.</li>\n<li><strong>Development Tools:</strong> Own solutions for everything: from tutorial system and Remote Config to <strong>unique input system with recording and playback of player actions</strong>, invaluable for debugging.</li>\n<li><strong>Dynamic Color Change System (Color):</strong> Architecture for changing color palettes of the entire game in real-time, with shader integration.</li>\n<li><strong>Game Modules:</strong> Ready-made solutions for specific mechanics, such as SearchSubjects (for Find 100 Cats) or PathCurveGenerator (for Triangle Alien).</li>\n<li>And much more...</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>Results and Current Status</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Full Technological Ecosystem Created:</strong> Developed a <mark>modular, reusable foundation</mark> that allows quickly launching new projects.</li>\n<li><strong>Successful Releases:</strong> Based on this ecosystem, <strong>two games have already been released on Google Play</strong> (<code>Find 100 Cats</code>, <code>Splash Blast</code>) and others are under development.</li>\n<li><strong>Active Brand Development:</strong> The studio has its own website, legal base, active Telegram community, and <strong>cooperates with publishers</strong>.</li>\n<li><strong>Key Competency:</strong> Grindset Studios is living proof of my ability to <mark>think big, design complex architecture, successfully implement products, and build a full-fledged brand around them</mark>.</li>\n</ul>\n","published":true,"title":"Grindset Studios","date":"2023-08 - present","type":"experience","tagsArray":["Mobile","Web"],"heroVideo":null,"shortDescription":"<p>Founded a studio by <strong>building a proprietary modular ecosystem</strong> that accelerates development. Responsible for the 100% cycle: from architecture to <strong>successful releases</strong> and publisher partnerships.</p>\n","storeLinks":["https://grindset.space/","https://play.google.com/store/apps/dev?id=4904492079701792773","https://www.youtube.com/@grindsetstd","https://www.tiktok.com/@grindsetstd"],"role":"founder","projectIcon":"/images/projects/23.08.GrindsetStudios/icon.webp","cardBackground":"/images/projects/23.08.GrindsetStudios/card.mp4?v=1765046935195","screenshots":[]}